    "Normal038970 calls host setup before creating Online and library workers. Source host_setup_complete attempts all-four-event activation at that earlier point, so the observed normal event chain cannot satisfy it.",
    "Later source milestones only update atomic bits; they do not call/schedule controller activation. Current production source leaves a later explicit retry to caller. Existing scenario source expects all milestones with foreign-ready false until manual retry; it was not rerun.",
    "Native00fd00 forwards unrecognized sockaddr combinations and skips global startup wait on80/443; wait(-1) occurs only in another recognized branch. Source connect body matches, but blanket native AdmissionLease precedes that body and can reject warming foreign calls before native branch selection.",
    "Setup-phase OriginalProvider rejects non-controller loads. Per-hook original publication and callback-specific startup dependencies must be designed together; removing global gate or seeding readiness would not establish correctness.",
